---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="What's collected on this site, and how to remove yourself" lang="en">
  <p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>

  <p>
    This is a small personal site, and it doesn't sell anything to
    anyone. Here's exactly what's collected, and who's involved:
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    Google Analytics only runs <strong>after you accept</strong> the
    cookie banner shown on your first visit. If you choose "Decline,"
    no data is collected at all. You can change your choice anytime by
    clearing your browser's site data.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact form</h2>
  <p>
    The name, email, and message you send go straight to me through
    <a href="https://resend.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Resend</a>
    (an email-sending service). The content isn't stored in any
    database — it just arrives in my inbox, like any regular email.
  </p>

  <h2>Update signup</h2>
  <p>
    If you signed up for lesson updates, your email address is stored
    as a contact in Resend, solely to send you those emails. You can
    remove yourself anytime via the <a href="/en/unsubscribe/">unsubscribe page</a>,
    or the link at the bottom of every email.
  </p>

  <h2>Bot protection</h2>
  <p>
    The contact and signup forms are protected by
    <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Turnstile</a>
    — an invisible CAPTCHA that checks you're not a bot, without
    collecting any additional personal data.
  </p>

  <p>
    Questions? Feel free to <a href="/en/contact/">get in touch</a>.
  </p>

  <p><a href="/en/">← Back to homepage</a></p>
</BaseLayout>
